<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: "'Microsoft YaHei', 'PingFang SC', 'Noto Sans CJK SC', sans-serif", padding: 0 }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 72, background: '#0E3F8C', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: '0 40px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>Paper2Video 项目汇报</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8FB6E8', letterSpacing: 2 }}>核心功能 3 / 3</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', padding: '24px 40px', gap: 16 }}>
        <Box style={{ height: 44, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 5, height: 34, background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 2 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>网页能点，钱花在明处</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#8B97A8', marginLeft: 6 }}>要联网的只有三步，产物按输入指纹存下来</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ height: 492, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 372, height: 492, background: '#E8EFF8', borderLeft: '5px solid #1E4FA8', borderRadius: 6, padding: '30px 26px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1E4FA8', letterSpacing: 2 }}>同一篇论文 · 一次生成</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 76, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', lineHeight: 1.05 }}>6.9万</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>幻灯片与讲稿这两步合计的 token，全部来自同一篇、同一次运行</Text>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                    <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#B5D4F4' }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>命中缓存后，同参数再跑一次</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>0 次联网调用</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 780, height: 492, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>要调云端的是这三步：把正文结构化成 LaTeX 工程、生成幻灯片、写讲稿与光标描述。它们的产物各按输入指纹存一份，命中就整段跳过，不重复计费。</Text>

                <Box style={{ height: 240, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '8px 12px' }}>
                    <Chart
                        style={{ width: '100%', height: 224 }}
                        chartType='barChart'
                        barDirection='column'
                        grouping='clustered'
                        title='这一篇论文，钱花在哪（token）'
                        titleColor='#0E3F8C'
                        showLegend={false}
                        showDataLabels={true}
                        axisColor='#8B97A8'
                        dataLabelColor='#1A2230'
                        colors={['#1E4FA8']}
                        data={[
                            ['环节', 'token'],
                            ['生成幻灯片 · 首次', 28525],
                            ['生成幻灯片 · 返工 1 次', 9866],
                            ['讲稿与光标描述', 31569],
                        ]}
                    />
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 18px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 6 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', letterSpacing: 1 }}>为什么只放同一篇的数据</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>换一篇论文，token 数立刻被两件事改写：论文有多长，以及幻灯片要返工几次。所以不同论文之间的数字没法互相比较——这一页只给同一篇内部的构成，那才是能对齐着看的。</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 48, padding: '0 40px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>数据来源：一次完整跑通的任务，token.json 按"幻灯片桶 + 讲稿桶"拆分</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>08 / 15</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
